# BrandOps Marketing Site — Environment Variables

This is the public BrandOps landing site (https://brandops.site).

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values before building locally.
No secrets should be committed.

# Google Analytics 4 — public Measurement ID (starts with G-)
# Optional. If omitted, GA4 is disabled entirely and the page still builds.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# EmailJS — public credentials for the contact and demo forms
# Get these from https://dashboard.emailjs.com after creating a service and template.
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key
